    {
      "id": "beab5c0a5f3c5042",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Fixed and pushed. `bobsgameweb` `8099ab8b..6d870d0f` on `main`.\n\n**Root cause**: The submodule `submodules/bobui` pointed to commit `354bed5c` in `bqt` — a dangling ref that existed on no remote and not even in the local clone (likely lost to a force-push or GC). The `--recursive` clone failed when it couldn't fetch that object.\n\n**Fix**: Updated the gitlink to `ac471b4e` (current valid `bqt/main` HEAD) and pushed. Jules' clone should now succeed.",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "memoryKind": "fact",
        "source": "memory_fact",
        "tags": [
          "session",
          "completed"
        ],
        "title": "session-summary"
