      "id": "fec03f1d0d116bcb",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Not much — just finished up the repo sync protocol. Here's where things stand:\n\n- **v5.284.0** pushed (root + fwber), all 112 submodules clean after wipe recovery\n- **HyperNexus kernel** rebuilt and running on 7778 (v1.0.13), dashboard live on 7779\n- **bobsgameweb** submodule pointer fixed for Jules (dangling `bqt` ref resolved)\n\nEverything's green. What's up?",
