      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: All junk prefixes are gone. Final state:\n\n**Cleaned (31 files):** removed `Videos - unknown year - unknown album - 00 -` / `unknown year - unknown album - 00 -` prefixes, retagged (artist/title/album/genre/year), renamed to `Artist - Year - Name` scheme.\n\n**Years filled from YouTube:**\n| File | Year | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| Mad Tribe – O.Z.O.R.A. Festival (live) | **2017** | original `OZORA Festival 2017 ᴴᴰ` (Dec 2017) |\n| Mad Tribe – Vinyl Set LiveStream (live) | **2020** | upload May 23, 2020 |\n| Mad Tribe – Livestream (VJ Picles) (live) | **2020** | upload May 30, 2020 |\n\n**Library:** 93 MP3s, zero `Unknown` years, zero `unknown album` / `Videos -` prefixes.\n\n**5 exact-size duplicates** kept with a ` (2)` suffix (original clean name already existed). Safe to delete if you don’t need b",
