    {
      "id": "ed18fa90a3fa3da8",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Fixed and pushed. Full chain:\n\n1. **`bqt`** (`ac471b4e..1cb99ecf`) — nested submodule gitlinks updated to valid upstream tips:\n   - `submodules/juce` → `454fe891` (JUCE `master` HEAD)\n   - `submodules/ultimatepp` → `a974b5bb` (ultimatepp `master` HEAD)\n2. **`bobsgameweb`** (`6d870d0f..932046b4`) — bumped `submodules/bobui` pointer to new `bqt` commit.\n\nThe dangling refs `73ebd079` (JUCE) and the old `bqt` pointer were both missing from their remotes. Jules' recursive clone should now resolve the full chain: `bobsgameweb` → `bqt` → `JUCE` + `ultimatepp`.",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "memoryKind": "fact",
