      "id": "1528a2223c776db0",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Done. Here's the answer and what I built.\n\n## Your question, answered directly\n\n**\"Is MiMoCode even using any plugin or extension API?\"** — **No.** The MiMoCode integration was using only **MCP + markdown** (skills, slash-command `.md` files, a custom agent, and a `hooks/config.json` that isn't even a real MiMoCode feature). It was **not** using MiMoCode's actual extension architecture at all.\n\n**\"Is there any functionality it's not yet using?\"** — **Yes, a lot.** MiMoCode ships a full **Plugin SDK** (`@mimo-ai/plugin` v0.1.14) that is the direct analog to Pi's ExtensionAPI, and none of it was wired up. Compared to the Pi extension (which maxes `pi.registerTool`, `pi.on`, `ctx.ui.*`, etc.), the MiMoCode side was leaving the entire equivalent surface on the table.\n\n## What I built (all veri",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "memoryKind": "fact",
        "source": "memory_fact",
        "tags": [
          "session",
          "completed"
        ],
        "title": "session-summary"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-10-18T05:10:56.5615275Z",
      "accessedAt": "2026-10-18T05:10:56.5615275Z",
      "accessCount": 0,
      "ttl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0a56b466e6059f6e",
      "content": "agent=checkpoint-writer-1 outcome=completed: Extraction complete. Both sections are now within budget:\n- **Architecture decisions**: removed 7 deploy/packaging entries (fwber Hetzner, realestatecrm Hetzner, DATABASE_URL, packaging, sub-service ×3)\n- **Discovered durable knowledge**: removed 4 deploy gotcha entries (Prisma DATABASE_URL, rm -rf prisma, Python str.replace, LeadG standalone)\n- **Spillover**: `MEMORY-deploy-patterns.md` (11 entries) — indexed at bottom of Discovered section",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "memoryKind": "fact",
        "source": "memory_fact",
