      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Logs clean. Here's the full answer to your question:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Dashboard Linking \u0026 Goal Statements — Now Complete\n\n### Does the main dashboard link to the sub-projects?\n\n**Now yes.** I added a **Sub-Projects section** to the CommandCenter dashboard with direct links to all 5 services:\n\n| Sub-Project | Link | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| LeadG — Voice \u0026 Lead Engine | `/leadg/` | ✅ Live (307 auth redirect) |\n| Foreclosure Workflow | `/foreclosure/` | ✅ Live (307 auth redirect) |\n| Content Planner | `/contentplanner/` | ✅ Live (200) |\n| Media Workflow | `/media-workflow/health` | ✅ Live (API-only) |\n| LegacyLeads | `/legacyleads/` | ✅ Live (200) |\n\nEach tile has a **tooltip** explaining what the service does and its port.\n\n### Does each state its goal?\n\n**Now yes — all 6 dashboards have goal sta",
