      "id": "7e4fa5218857ece7",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: All pages 200. `.map()` guard fixes deployed.\n\n---\n\n## Unguarded `.map()` Fixes Complete\n\n| Metric | Result |\n|--------|--------|\n| **API-response `.map()` calls found** | 79 |\n| **Guards added** | 79 (`|| []`) |\n| **Syntax breakages from script** | 2 (fixed immediately) |\n| **Files changed** | 58 |\n\n### What Was Fixed\n- `activities.map(` → `(activities || []).map(`\n- `peers.map(` → `(peers || []).map(`\n- `conversations.map(` → `(conversations || []).map(`\n- `notifications.map(` → `(notifications || []).map(`\n- ...and 75 more API-response props\n\n### Script Bug Caught \u0026 Fixed\n- `journal.(tags || []).map(` → `(journal.tags || []).map(`\n- `res.(items || []).map(` → `(res.items || []).map(`\n\n### Production Status\n- ✅ Build clean, PM2 running\n- ✅ All key pages 200 (home, dashboard, journal, mes",
