    {
      "id": "4874c743baa53b86",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: Logs clean. Here's the summary:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Fixed — 500 Errors on Auth \u0026 Workflows\n\n**Root cause:** Prisma Turbopack symlink was broken. The deploy command created:\n```\nclient-2c3a283f134fdcb6 → node_modules/@prisma/client  ❌ (wrong relative path)\n```\nShould be:\n```\nclient-2c3a283f134fdcb6 → client  ✅ (sibling directory)\n```\n\nThis caused `Cannot find module '@prisma/client-2c3a283f134fdcb6'` → every Prisma-dependent route returned 500 (auth, workflows, dashboard).\n\n**Fixed:**\n- Symlink corrected on server → all endpoints now 200/307\n- `deploy/package-v3.py` — includes `post-deploy.sh` with correct `ln -sfn client` command\n- `deploy/deploy.sh` — new deploy script with symlink fix + verification\n- All previously failing endpoints verified:\n  - `/api/auth/session` → **200** ✅\n  - `/dashboard`",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "memoryKind": "fact",
        "source": "memory_fact",
        "tags": [
          "session",
          "completed"
        ],
        "title": "session-summary"
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-10-18T15:46:46.7028236Z",
      "accessedAt": "2026-10-18T15:46:46.7028236Z",
      "accessCount": 0,
      "ttl": null
    },
