      "id": "e22e149aff43c1e8",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: **Yes — all 5 sub-projects are linked on the main dashboard.** Here's the verification:\n\n## ✅ Sub-Projects Section — Live on `https://excellegacyrealtygroup.site`\n\nClick **\"Sub-Projects\"** in the left section rail of the Command Center.\n\n| Sub-Project | Link | Status | What it does |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **LeadG — Voice \u0026 Lead Engine** | `/leadg/` | ✅ 307 (auth) | AI voice campaigns, outbound calling |\n| **Foreclosure Workflow** | `/foreclosure/` | ✅ 307 (auth) | Legal intake \u0026 foreclosure monitoring |\n| **Content Planner** | `/contentplanner/` | ✅ 200 | Social media \u0026 campaigns |\n| **Media Workflow** | `/media-workflow/health` | ✅ API-only | Photo/video pipeline |\n| **LegacyLeads** | `/legacyleads/` | ✅ 200 | Property data \u0026 skip tracing |\n\nEach tile has:\n- A **tooltip** (hover the `i` bad",
