    {
      "id": "4b05fe307b1f39d5",
      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: All work items are complete. Here's the final status.\n\n## Session complete — all deliverables done\n\n**T1: MiMoCode extension maximized** (your \"do all of the above\") — answered your original question too:\n- **Before:** it used only MCP + markdown (skills/commands/agents) — **no plugin/extension API at all**.\n- **Now:** a full `@mimo-ai/plugin` server plugin (**9 typed tools + 10 hooks** incl. retrieval-augmented L2 memory, conversation monitor, session/tool lifecycle, permission hints) + a TUI plugin (**5 slash commands**), wired into `install.js` (junction + BOM + config).\n- **Live end-to-end verified:** the model called `hypernexus_search_tools {\"query\":\"file\"}` and got back real kernel catalog data (Figma/Filesystem/Slack MCP + Go-native tools).\n\n**Roadmap \"1,2,3,4,5\" — all complete:**",
