      "content": "agent=main outcome=completed: The persistent shell session is completely dead. Here's the situation:\n\n**What's done:**\n- `ハイパーポルノ_full.mp4` — 10,589 MB (normal full, valid H.264/AAC)\n- `ハイパーポルノ_altaudio_full.mp4` — 10,583 MB (Space Tribe full, valid H.264/AAC)\n- `ハイパーポルノ.mp4` (your renamed 2 GB) — 1,812 MB, valid H.264 High/AAC, faststart OK\n- `ハイパーポルノ_pmv.mp4` — remuxed with mp42 brand (same codec)\n\n**The PMVHaven problem:** Your file is already H.264/AAC/MP4 — exactly what they ask for. The \"couldn't finish processing\" is likely their transcoder failing on the **3-hour duration** (10,774 s). The file itself is not corrupted.\n\n**A Main-profile re-encode was launched** (`ハイパーポルノ_pmv2.mp4`) but the shell died before I could monitor it. You can check it yourself in PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n# Check if encode is still ru",
