      "id": "411f36049dc7a26b",
      "content": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\n== 1. Module surface\\n  ok   default export exists\\n  ok   plugin id is 'hypernexus'\\n  ok   setup is a function\\n  ok   V1 server() shim is a function\\n  ok   exports TOOLS (28)\\n  ok   exports COMMANDS (10)\\n  ok   exports SKILLS (3)\\n\\n== 2. RPC contract consistency\\n  ok   rpc.TOOL covers every registered tool\\n  ok   rpc.COMMAND covers every command\\n  ok   every tool has JSON-schema input\\n  ok   every tool has description\\n  ok   every tool has run()\\n\\n== 3. Registration surface\\n  ok   setup returns cleanup function\\n  ok   namespace registered\\n  ok   28 tools registered\\n  ok   tool names match rpc contract\\n  ok   10 commands registered\\n  ok   3 skills registered with path\\n  ok   skill SKILL.md files materialized\\n  ok   MCP server 'hypernexus' registered\\n  ok   MCP type local + command array\\n  ok   MCP env passes kernel URL\\n  ok   MCP startup timeout set\\n  ok   worktree strategy registered\\n  ok   session hooks registered (prompt/context/compaction/model.request/retry)\\n  ok   tool hooks registered (execute.before/execute.after)\\n  ok   permission hook registered (evaluate)\\n  ok   shell hook registered (create.before)\\n  ok   storage boot record written\\n\\n== 4. Worktree strategy behavior\\n  ok   create returns directory\\n  ok   create writes linkage marker\\n  ok   list finds managed worktree\\n  ok   remove deletes marker\\n\\n== 5. Tool execution — live kernel\\n  ok   tool status returns content string\\n  ok   tool system_overview returns content string\\nnode : [hypernexus] opencode plugin v1.1.0 loaded — kernel v1.0.13 online @ \\r\\nC:\\\\Users\\\\hyper\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\hn-opencode-test-h7igzu\\r\\nAt line:1 char:1\\r\\n+ node bin/test-opencode-ext.mjs 2\u003e\u00261\\r\\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\r\\n    + CategoryInfo          : NotSpecified: ([hypernexus] op...ode-test-h7igzu:String) [], RemoteException\\r\\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : NativeCommandError\\r\\n \\r\\n  ok   tool memory_store returns content string\\n  ok   tool memory_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool memory_fts_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool memory_vector_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool memory_list returns content string\\n  ok   tool scratchpad returns content string\\n  ok   tool context_harvest returns content string\\n  ok   tool record_observation returns content string\\n  ok   tool tool_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool tool_discover returns content string\\n  ok   tool suggest_tools returns content string\\n  ok   tool mcp_status returns content string\\n  ok   tool mcp_servers returns content string\\n  ok   tool mcp_tools returns content string\\n  ok   tool mcp_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool mcp_call returns content string\\n  ok   tool session_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool session_context returns content string\\n  ok   tool session_handoff returns content string\\n  ok   tool skill_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool skill_manage returns content string\\n  ok   tool code_search returns content string\\n  ok   tool knowledge_graph returns content string\\n  ok   tool billing_status returns content string\\n  ok   tool audit_log returns content string\\n  ok   tool subagent returns content string\\n  ok   all tools executed without throwing\\n  ok   status reports kernel online\\n  ok   memory_store persisted\\n  ok   memory_search finds stored fact\\n  ok   scratchpad round-trips\\n  ok   session_handoff pickup responds\\n  ok   session_context returns bootstrap + links\\n  ok   session_context cross-session links parse (no 'invalid JSON body')\\n  ok   knowledge_graph returns graph payload\\n\\n== 6. Command execution\\n  ok   command hn-status executes\\n  ok   command hn-store executes\\n  ok   command hn-remember executes\\n  ok   command hn-search executes\\n  ok   command hn-tools executes\\n  ok   command hn-session executes\\n  ok   command hn-context executes\\n  ok   command hn-plan executes\\n  ok   command hn-summary executes\\n  ok   command hn-purge executes\\n …",
