      "content": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"=== T10-MCP-SWEEP: chat-surface extras ===\\r\\n  SOFT  inspect_window_ui — {\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Tool 'inspect_window_ui' not implemented in Go and Node server is unreachable.\\\"\\r\\n=== T10-MCP-SWEEP: stdio transport (hypernexus mcp) ===\\r\\n  PASS  stdio initialize — {\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"capabilities\\\":{\\\"tools\\\":{\\\"listChanged\\\":false}},\\\"protocol\\r\\n  PASS  stdio tools/list — 58 tools\\r\\n  PASS  stdio tool count covers registry — stdio=58 registry=47\\r\\n  PASS  stdio tools/call hello_world — {\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Hello, stdio-sweep!\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}\\r\\n=== T10-MCP-SWEEP SUMMARY: 46 invoked — 45 pass, 1 soft (graceful), 0 fail, 6 skipped ===\\r\\n\"}]",
