    {
      "id": "b1aecbfaf4d07672",
      "content": "OpenCode V2 plugin delivered at addons/opencode (28 tools, 10 hn-* commands, 3 skills, session/tool/permission/shell hooks, MCP auto-registration, worktree strategy, V1 shim). Critical: Skill.Info schema requires path or OpenCode disables the whole plugin (transform failure). options.baseUrl must propagate to tool executors via RUNTIME_BASE. Kernel v1.0.14 adds 6 router tools (mcp_status/mcp_list_servers/mcp_list_tools/mcp_call_tool/mcp_server_test/inspect_window_ui) in go/internal/tools/kernel_bridge.go so all 58 MCP tools work via both stdio and /api/agent/tool. Verified 196/196: test-opencode-ext 109, test-mcp-tools 23, test-mcp-sweep 46, test-core-noext 18.",
