    {
      "id": "cfaf3e17cfcec0b9",
      "content": "Added hypernexus_memory_delete (id + tag fan-out) and /hn-restore; tool hooks now record structured file-change/file-read observations (filesModified/filesRead) to the knowledge graph; assistant-turn advertiser feed; hot-path context injection parallelized with negative caching. Fixed hn-purge (was sending {tag} to an {id}-only API) and a sessionID scope bug in the context hook. Multi-agent note: a pi-harness agent committed 8849daf04 concurrently on the shared branch - stacked cleanly. Trap: PowerShell 5.1 Set-Content -Encoding utf8 writes BOM; use byte-level writes (239,187,191 detected + stripped). Verified 269/269 across 6 batteries.",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
      "metadata": {
        "client": "opencode",
        "memoryKind": "fact",
        "source": "handoff",
        "tags": [
          "opencode",
          "plugin",
          "v1.0.15",
          "session-summary",
          "multi-agent"
        ],
        "title": "OpenCode extension v1.0.15 session 2"
      },
