      "id": "e356da20f6905399",
      "content": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[hypernexus-install] done. Restart OpenCode (or run `opencode service restart`) to load the plugin.\\r\\n== E2E-1. Plugin load-state (GET /api/plugin)\\n  FAIL GET /api/plugin responds — spawnSync opencode ENOENT\\n  FAIL hypernexus plugin is loaded\\n== E2E-2. Session + report commands (no model involved)\\n  FAIL session created — {\\\"__error\\\":\\\"spawnSync opencode ENOENT\\\"}\\n  FAIL command hn-status accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-store accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-plan accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-restore accepted — no session\\n  FAIL session contains synthetic output — no session\\n  FAIL hn-status report persisted — no session\\n  FAIL hn-store confirmation persisted — no session\\n  FAIL hn-store fact reached the HyperNexus kernel — no session\\n\\n== E2E SUMMARY: 0/11 passed\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Exited with code 1\"}]",
