      "id": "6b6e7082945b45c5",
      "content": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"== E2E-1. Plugin load-state (GET /api/plugin)\\n  FAIL GET /api/plugin responds — Command failed: cmd.exe /c opencode get /api/plugin\\n\\nERROR\\n  Unexpected positional argument: \\\"/api/plugin\\\"\\n\\n  FAIL hypernexus plugin is loaded\\n== E2E-2. Session + report commands (no model involved)\\nnode : \\r\\nAt line:1 char:1\\r\\n+ node bin/test-opencode-e2e.mjs 2\u003e\u00261\\r\\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\r\\n    + CategoryInfo          : NotSpecified: (:String) [], RemoteException\\r\\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : NativeCommandError\\r\\n \\r\\nERROR\\r\\n  Unexpected positional argument: \\\"/api/plugin\\\"\\r\\n  FAIL session created — {\\\"__error\\\":\\\"Command failed: cmd.exe /c opencode post /api/session --data {\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"e2e-hypernexus\\\\\\\"}\\\\n\\\\nERROR\\\\n  Unre\\n  FAIL command hn-status accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-store accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-plan accepted — no session\\n  FAIL command hn-restore accepted — no session\\n  FAIL session contains synthetic output — no session\\n  FAIL hn-status report persisted — no session\\n  FAIL hn-store confirmation persisted — no session\\n  FAIL hn-store fact reached the HyperNexus kernel — no session\\n\\n== E2E SUMMARY: 0/11 passed\\nERROR\\r\\n  Unrecognized flag: --data in command opencode\\r\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Exited with code 1\"}]",
      "type": "working",
