    {
      "id": "74a751e3845be7b4",
      "content": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"6209f45bb chore(mimo): sync regenerated commands/skills/agents from fixed generator\\n8262860f8 fix(mimo): sync generate.mjs with corrected kernel endpoints\\n8a42e67a3 fix(mimo): repair 9 MiMo Desktop tools calling dead kernel endpoints\\n062be57d6 fix(config): accept legacy TORMENTNEXUS_WORKSPACE_ROOT env var\\n54d5b3d23 feat(mimo): add billing_status + add_fact tools (22 total)\\n847f3d432 fix(mimo): repair 3 broken kernel endpoints in mimocode plugin\\ncommit 54d5b3d23472918c2be12c6ab935b476d76205a1\\r\\nAuthor: opencode \u003copencode@bot.com\u003e\\r\\nDate:   Mon Oct 19 21:43:47 2026 -0400\\r\\n\\r\\n    feat(mimo): add billing_status + add_fact tools (22 total)\\r\\n    \\r\\n    - hypernexus_billing_status: provider quotas/pricing (parity with pi)\\r\\n    - hypernexus_add_fact: structured fact/observation/decision write with kind+tags\\r\\n    Brings mimocode to 22 typed tools + 26 hooks (maximal SDK surface).\\r\\n\\r\\n addons/mimo/plugin/hypernexus/index.js | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\r\\n 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)\\r\\n\"}]",
