    {
      "id": "f2b13d8048394b70",
      "content": "Added hypernexus_memory_relate (knowledge-graph writes) and bin/test-opencode-e2e.mjs real end-to-end battery (opencode HTTP API: plugin load-state via GET /api/plugin?location[directory]=..., session create, POST /api/session/{id}/command with {name,text} body, synthetic persistence polling, command-to-kernel persistence). Fixed memory_store id (kernel wraps record at data.memory.id). Multi-agent: shared test-extensions.mjs exact-count assertion broke on concurrent mimocode growth (20-\u003e22 tools) - changed to floor + required names. API gotchas: opencode CLI is npm .ps1 shim (Node must spawn cmd.exe /c); GET /api/plugin defaults to C:/Users/hyper location and needs location[directory] deepObject; command body is {name,text}. Verified 285/285 across 7 batteries.",
      "type": "working",
      "namespace": "project",
